=====================================================================
ACKNOWLEDGEMENTS / 致謝
=====================================================================

This project, InvestSim (台灣投資人生模擬器), is inspired by and
built upon the spirit of the following projects:

1. Life-TW (鬼島人生) by kai890707
   GitHub: https://github.com/kai890707/Life-TW
   A text-based life simulation game for Taiwan players.
   We deeply respect the original creator's work on game mechanics,
   event-driven design, and the courage to build something fun for
   the Taiwanese community. InvestSim focuses on the investment and
   financial decision-making dimension of life simulation.

2. BitLife by Candywriter, LLC
   Website: https://bitlife.com/
   Life-TW was itself inspired by BitLife, the pioneering mobile
   life simulator. We extend our respect to Candywriter for creating
   the genre that inspired this entire chain of creators.

Without these prior works, InvestSim would not exist.

