DISCLAIMER
=====================================================================

InvestSim is a SIMULATION GAME for EDUCATIONAL and ENTERTAINMENT
purposes ONLY. It does NOT constitute financial advice, investment
advice, trading advice, or any other sort of advice.

Investment involves risk. Past simulated performance is not
indicative of future real-world results. Always consult a qualified
financial advisor before making real investment decisions.

The creators of InvestSim are not responsible for any financial
decisions made based on gameplay experience.
